  @case 'tailQN is the source past the rendered end, whatever shortened the take'  [harness]  @ 945-954
  @case 'head, rendered length and tail partition the source'  [harness]  @ 957-969
  @case 'a trimmed take is capped by the gap, and regrows to source-minus-head without one'  [harness]  @ 972-985
  @case 'trimming the head of a resized take keeps the end where the resize put it'  [harness]  @ 988-999
  @case 'splitTake cuts a take into two pooled halves that meet at the cut'  [harness]  @ 1005-1022
  @case 'the lower half inherits the natural, so the pair ends where the whole did'  [harness]  @ 1025-1037
  @case 'splitting a head-trimmed take leaves both halves on the source origin'  [harness]  @ 1040-1054
  @case 'a split is refused on either edge, off the take, and on audio'  [harness]  @ 1057-1070
  @case 'deleteTake removes the item, leaving the other take intact'  [harness]  @ 1074-1085
  @case 'deleteTake parks a slot\'s last instance; the slot survives, greyed'  [harness]  @ 1091-1107
  @case 'deleteTake of a non-last instance deletes outright (no park)'  [harness]  @ 1111-1126
  @case 're-dropping from a parked slot re-materialises off the keeper'  [harness]  @ 1130-1143
  @case 'deleteSlot forever-deletes: live instances and the parked keeper'  [harness]  @ 1147-1160
  @case 'deleteSlot forever-deletes the pool per-event metadata'  [harness]  @ 1164-1175
  @case 'mintParkedTake shows the new slot at once; isParkedTake flags scratch-hosted takes'  [harness]  @ 1179-1194
  @case 'vary replaces the instance with one of a fresh variant slot'  [harness]  @ 1201-1223
